---
import FillButton from "../FillButton.astro"
import GhostButton from "../GhostButton.astro"
---

<section id="community" class="community-section navy__band">

    <div class="community-information">
        <h1>Why <em>Allegheny College</em> Computer & Information Science?</h1>
        <p>
            The Computer and Information Science field is increasingly saturated with specialists, but as the global approach to computing becomes more holistic and ethically concerned, those with broader knowledge and an open mind secure their place.<br/><br/>
            We offer 4 majors, and though some are designed to focus on one aspect of CIS, our curriculum remains all-encompassing to give our students the edge they need in today’s job market.
        </p>
        <div class="community-buttons">
            <a href="/plan/mypath"><FillButton>Plan Your Path Here</FillButton></a>
            <a href="#faculty"><GhostButton>Learn More</GhostButton></a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="community-image image__slider">
        <img src = "cis.allegheny.edu/img/placeholder.jpg" alt = "Placeholder hero photo"/>
    </div>

</section>